            <ArticleTitle>The role of radiation therapy in vertebral hemangiomas without neurological signs.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>77-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe 5 patients with vertebral haemangiomas treated by radiotherapy of 30-40 Gy, 2-3 Gy/day. The management of vertebral haemangiomas is discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
